        },
        "quote": "(c) Lateral storm sewers and those which accompany street improvements shall be paid for by the owner of the subdivision or guaranteed as set forth in this division.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.45.070:block:2#text",
