          "start": 749
        },
        "quote": "(d) Main storm sewers shall be furnished by the owner of the subdivision or guaranteed as set forth in this division if it serves only the subdivision for which it is provided. If in the opinion of the Council it would be beneficial and in the best interest for future development outside of the subdivision to do so, a benefit district for a main storm sewer shall be formed and the cost paid by special assessment as provided by law. (Code 1981 § 41-124. Code 1995 § 134-172.)",
